<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10016] Web Console: ClusterLoginService should return &quot;Credentials&quot; modal as singleton</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10016</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8428&quot; title=&quot;Web Console: Support connect to secured cluster&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-8428&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-8428&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; we implemented&#160;ClusterLoginService that will show modal to enter credentials if authentication enabled on Ignite cluster.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But if this code is triggered form Promises it will lead to situation when this modal will be shown several times.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This can be fixed if modal will be a singleton.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
